WEBVTT

00:14.180 --> 00:17.350
<i>He is Ranma of the Saotome School
of Anything Goes Martial Arts.</i>

00:20.854 --> 00:24.858
<i>She is Akane of the Tendo Dojo.</i>

00:25.775 --> 00:28.945
<i>The two of them are now engaged
due to their parents' decision.</i>

00:29.028 --> 00:30.363
Don't decide who I'll marry.

00:30.447 --> 00:31.698
It's irritating.

00:31.781 --> 00:34.200
<i>And Ranma has a problem.</i>

00:37.245 --> 00:40.707
<i>He transforms into a girl
when he's splashed with water.</i>

00:46.296 --> 00:50.550
RANMA1/2

02:12.590 --> 02:17.428
KODACHI, THE BLACK ROSE

02:31.860 --> 02:33.820
They gave me a freebie.

02:33.903 --> 02:37.407
The girl form is the way to go
when I'm out buyin' food.

02:37.991 --> 02:40.285
Furinkan High School students.

02:42.412 --> 02:45.123
Why the rush?

02:45.206 --> 02:48.251
We will face off in a week anyway.

02:49.169 --> 02:50.628
Stop blabbering.

02:50.712 --> 02:52.380
We have you now.

02:52.463 --> 02:54.215
I'll end your life, right here!

02:55.008 --> 02:56.759
Why are they bandaged up like mummies?

02:57.260 --> 02:58.386
Get ready!

03:05.643 --> 03:08.438
You won't listen, will you?

03:10.106 --> 03:11.983
This is what happens

03:13.067 --> 03:14.152
to fools like you!

03:14.235 --> 03:15.987
There! Take this!

03:16.070 --> 03:17.989
That'll show you.

03:20.950 --> 03:22.368
Stop it.

03:22.869 --> 03:25.163
The fight is obviously over.

03:25.788 --> 03:28.917
You easily saw through my ribbon work.

03:30.168 --> 03:33.338
You are no ordinary woman, are you?

03:33.421 --> 03:36.007
Well, yeah, I'm not an ordinary woman.

03:36.925 --> 03:38.051
I...

03:41.012 --> 03:44.224
show no mercy against women!

03:45.850 --> 03:47.185
There.

03:55.151 --> 03:57.070
You are pretty strong, aren't you?

03:57.570 --> 04:01.074
I am the black rose
of St. Bacchus' School for Girls.

04:02.325 --> 04:03.993
Kodachi, the Black Rose.

04:04.077 --> 04:06.120
Do remember my name.

04:17.548 --> 04:18.800
I feel defeated.

04:18.883 --> 04:20.426
We lost to a woman like her.

04:20.927 --> 04:23.846
- Get over yourselves, you're men.
- What?

04:23.930 --> 04:25.598
No, we're girls!

04:25.682 --> 04:28.017
We belong to the Furinkan High School...

04:28.101 --> 04:29.310
Rhythmic Gymnastics.

04:30.311 --> 04:33.481
<i>These girls are in my class.</i>

04:34.774 --> 04:36.192
ANYTHING GOES MARTIAL ARTS
TENDO DOJO

04:36.276 --> 04:38.069
The entire team was wiped out?

04:38.152 --> 04:40.488
We were ambushed.

04:40.571 --> 04:42.991
It was Kodachi, the Black Rose.

04:43.074 --> 04:45.368
Kodachi, the Black Rose?

04:45.451 --> 04:48.329
Our match is in a week.

04:48.413 --> 04:50.415
At this rate, we'll have to forfeit.

04:51.082 --> 04:54.419
So you want me to be your stand-in?

04:55.003 --> 04:56.296
Please, Akane.

04:56.379 --> 04:58.673
You're our only hope.

04:58.756 --> 05:00.883
You see, the upcoming match...

05:00.967 --> 05:05.013
...is Martial Arts Rhythmic Gymnastics!

05:05.096 --> 05:06.889
Martial Arts Rhythmic Gymnastics?

05:07.390 --> 05:08.641
The heck is that?

05:08.725 --> 05:12.103
The gymnasts from each school
compete against each other

05:12.186 --> 05:14.939
using acrobatics technique and tools.

05:15.023 --> 05:16.024
ILLUSTRATION

05:16.107 --> 05:18.276
Makes perfect sense...

05:20.069 --> 05:21.070
Akane!

05:21.154 --> 05:24.407
You're the only one
who has a fighting chance against her.

05:24.490 --> 05:25.491
Please.

05:25.575 --> 05:27.327
Do this for us, Akane.

05:27.410 --> 05:28.619
All right.

05:28.703 --> 05:31.831
I don't really understand, but I'll do it.

05:33.499 --> 05:35.918
I'll avenge you.

05:37.253 --> 05:39.797
- Thank you, Akane!
- Thank you.

05:40.757 --> 05:41.883
DOJO ENTRANCE THIS WAY

05:41.966 --> 05:44.177
I can't believe
you agreed to it this easily.

05:44.761 --> 05:47.138
Do you even know how to use the tools?

05:47.221 --> 05:48.514
The tools?

05:48.598 --> 05:51.601
I've never tried,
but I'll get the hang of it.

05:52.101 --> 05:53.519
You sure about that?

05:54.979 --> 05:56.272
Look.

05:56.355 --> 05:58.357
Where have you been?

05:59.609 --> 06:00.943
Come this way.

06:04.489 --> 06:07.116
I was worried sick about you, P-chan.

06:07.200 --> 06:08.201
P-chan?

06:08.701 --> 06:10.119
He's a little piggy.

06:10.203 --> 06:11.579
"P" for pig, he's P-chan.

06:13.331 --> 06:15.374
You guys have grown
pretty close, haven't you?

06:15.458 --> 06:19.378
That's what happens
when we sleep together every night.

06:19.462 --> 06:20.630
Every night?

06:20.713 --> 06:21.714
Isn't that right?

06:22.673 --> 06:24.509
But sometimes he goes off to places.

06:24.592 --> 06:27.637
Be good and stay right here, P-chan.

06:27.720 --> 06:29.597
Ranma, don't bully him.

06:39.440 --> 06:40.858
Hey there, Ryoga.

06:40.942 --> 06:43.861
I can see you've become a pig,
even at heart.

06:45.029 --> 06:47.615
The way you cling to her is just pathetic.

06:49.033 --> 06:50.952
I'll show you--

06:51.911 --> 06:54.288
Didn't I tell you to be nice?

06:55.081 --> 06:56.165
Here I go.

07:01.379 --> 07:02.380
Done!

07:07.802 --> 07:09.679
Don't you want to catch them?

07:10.930 --> 07:12.181
I know.

07:13.683 --> 07:15.309
How about the ribbon to start?

07:16.144 --> 07:17.145
I can do this.

07:18.229 --> 07:19.230
Here I go.

07:22.442 --> 07:24.193
The ribbon shouldn't get tangled, right?

07:24.861 --> 07:26.279
Be quiet.

07:27.655 --> 07:28.656
Let's go.

07:30.032 --> 07:31.033
Hup.

07:36.080 --> 07:38.666
Don't you want
the hoop to stay in one piece?

07:38.749 --> 07:42.003
I've had enough!
What the hell is wrong with them?

07:42.086 --> 07:45.298
- Your real issue is the lack of elegance.
- Stupid, stupid!

07:45.882 --> 07:46.883
Stop talking!

07:47.383 --> 07:48.676
You pipe down.

08:13.201 --> 08:14.494
Well, sorry I'm clumsy.

08:14.577 --> 08:16.954
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

08:17.038 --> 08:18.664
Hey, how is that my fault?

08:19.624 --> 08:21.083
I can be your coach.

08:23.711 --> 08:24.712
Ryoga?

08:25.630 --> 08:27.715
What's that, P-chan?

08:27.798 --> 08:29.675
Who you callin' P-chan?

08:29.759 --> 08:31.594
Yeah, I wonder.

08:31.677 --> 08:34.013
Ryoga, I didn't know you could be so kind.

08:34.555 --> 08:36.140
Oh, yeah?

08:40.478 --> 08:41.479
The ribbon.

08:47.026 --> 08:48.444
That was amazing!

08:48.528 --> 08:49.570
It's nothing, really.

08:50.112 --> 08:51.280
You bastard.

09:00.414 --> 09:02.542
We'll be done with today's training.

09:03.251 --> 09:04.794
Thank you for your instruction.

09:06.504 --> 09:08.381
I was impressed by your ribbon work.

09:09.090 --> 09:10.633
You'll improve in no time.

09:11.133 --> 09:13.094
Do you mean it, Ryoga?

09:13.594 --> 09:15.680
He's obviously lying.

09:16.389 --> 09:17.974
No one asked you, Ranma.

09:20.393 --> 09:25.189
Ready or not, the Martial Arts
Rhythmic Gymnastics match is next week.

09:25.731 --> 09:29.110
Why did I agree to help?

09:30.319 --> 09:33.030
I can't bear to keep watching.

09:33.614 --> 09:35.783
You're a shameless runt.

09:35.866 --> 09:37.535
You suck-up.

09:38.703 --> 09:40.538
It's pathetic to watch you be jealous.

09:40.621 --> 09:42.873
Who's jealous?

09:46.627 --> 09:48.546
Ryoga, you bastard.

09:49.338 --> 09:52.842
Thinking of clambering
into Akane's bed again?

09:56.721 --> 09:57.763
Wait up, pig!

10:05.563 --> 10:07.648
They called for help.

10:07.732 --> 10:11.819
How deplorable,
Furinkan High School Rhythmic Gymnastics.

10:12.320 --> 10:14.572
And I thought I taught them a lesson.

10:17.199 --> 10:18.659
Akane Tendo.

10:24.040 --> 10:28.794
I, Kodachi, the Black Rose,
will render you immobile.

10:35.176 --> 10:36.761
Sheesh, I'm worn out.

10:36.844 --> 10:38.971
That was one tough training.

10:39.680 --> 10:41.140
Akane Tendo.

10:47.396 --> 10:49.774
Meet your end!

10:52.401 --> 10:53.778
Who are you?

10:55.112 --> 10:58.032
I'm with St. Bacchus' School for Girls
Martial Arts Rhythmic Gymnastics.

10:58.532 --> 10:59.992
I'm Kodachi, the Black Rose.

11:01.952 --> 11:04.622
I'm your opponent for the upcoming match.

11:04.705 --> 11:09.210
Shall we engage now
fair and square, without use of tricks?

11:12.838 --> 11:14.256
How is any of this

11:14.924 --> 11:17.593
fair or square?

11:19.553 --> 11:23.307
You're the one who ambushed the girls!

11:23.391 --> 11:25.518
Ambushed? That's misleading.

11:26.102 --> 11:28.187
I believe in doing my best

11:28.270 --> 11:31.357
to secure a victory
even before the match begins.

11:31.440 --> 11:33.317
You don't think that's underhanded?

11:33.401 --> 11:34.527
Underhanded?

11:35.027 --> 11:37.780
A match starts long before the bell rings.

11:37.863 --> 11:39.740
What are you blabbing on about?

11:39.824 --> 11:41.909
Please, don't hesitate to fight back--

11:43.244 --> 11:44.412
Wait, you hog!

11:46.080 --> 11:47.081
Lil pig!

11:47.873 --> 11:48.874
Stop

11:49.583 --> 11:51.293
hopping around!

11:52.044 --> 11:53.212
I said hold still!

11:53.921 --> 11:55.339
I know you understand me.

11:56.841 --> 11:58.134
- Damn it.
- Hey.

11:58.717 --> 12:01.262
Ranma, you're at it again!
Stop bullying him!

12:07.810 --> 12:09.145
Akane Tendo.

12:09.770 --> 12:12.189
You are a decent fighter, like I heard.

12:13.023 --> 12:14.942
I will be back.

12:15.443 --> 12:16.735
Rose petals!

12:23.409 --> 12:26.412
Who do you think
has to clean up after your mess?

12:28.497 --> 12:30.124
Akane, are you done in here?

12:30.207 --> 12:32.042
Can you keep it down at night?

12:32.126 --> 12:33.335
I need my beauty sleep<i>.</i>

12:33.919 --> 12:35.504
Kodachi, the Black Rose.

12:35.588 --> 12:38.299
Just wait till I pay you back
in the match.

12:40.384 --> 12:41.802
<i>Akane Tendo.</i>

12:42.303 --> 12:45.389
<i>I will destroy you before our match,
no matter what it takes.</i>

12:49.059 --> 12:50.060
A pig?

12:50.144 --> 12:51.562
Stop getting away, Ryoga!

12:56.692 --> 12:57.693
Oh, snap.

13:05.409 --> 13:06.827
Hey, you okay?

13:14.752 --> 13:16.003
<i>He's handsome.</i>

13:16.086 --> 13:19.173
<i>Wait, she's Kodachi, the Black Rose
or whatever, isn't she?</i>

13:21.425 --> 13:22.426
<i>Blush.</i>

13:22.968 --> 13:24.428
I... I...

13:24.512 --> 13:25.930
I was terrified.

13:26.514 --> 13:28.057
H-Hey now.

13:28.140 --> 13:29.934
<i>What's with her?</i>

13:30.017 --> 13:33.771
<i>I've had a drab life
at the girls-only school.</i>

13:34.271 --> 13:36.357
<i>Days spent grinding through
gymnastics routines.</i>

13:37.066 --> 13:40.819
I was on the brink of surrendering
my dreams of blissful courtships.

13:43.447 --> 13:47.034
<i>Who would have guessed that an encounter
of a lifetime was in store for me?</i>

13:48.452 --> 13:50.496
What is your name?

13:50.579 --> 13:53.374
I'm Ranma Saotome.

13:55.000 --> 13:56.919
My Ranma, please accept this.

14:03.008 --> 14:06.303
I happened to lace the bouquet
with a paralytic drug.

14:06.387 --> 14:09.431
What the hell are you thinking?

14:11.892 --> 14:13.227
Now, my Ranma.

14:14.228 --> 14:16.063
Have heart...

14:18.232 --> 14:20.192
and please

14:20.985 --> 14:24.280
steal my lips.

14:28.075 --> 14:31.078
What are you doing right above my room?

14:32.329 --> 14:35.708
Oh, dear, what an untimely interruption.

14:37.084 --> 14:40.629
I will see you again, my Ranma!

14:41.213 --> 14:42.715
What is wrong with her?

14:47.553 --> 14:49.805
Sorry to interrupt your romance.

14:49.889 --> 14:50.890
Good night.

14:51.891 --> 14:53.183
<i>I'm pathetic.</i>

14:58.314 --> 14:59.815
<i>Kodachi, the Black Rose.</i>

15:01.150 --> 15:04.570
<i>Now I really can't lose.</i>

15:06.655 --> 15:08.115
Morning.

15:08.198 --> 15:09.575
Yeah, I saw.

15:10.242 --> 15:11.577
Good morning, Akane.

15:12.244 --> 15:13.287
Morning.

15:14.038 --> 15:17.333
I heard you're competing
in the upcoming gymnastics match.

15:17.416 --> 15:18.417
Yes, I am.

15:18.500 --> 15:19.919
Way to go. I hope you win.

15:20.002 --> 15:21.128
Leave it to me.

15:22.087 --> 15:24.089
Speaking of, isn't today...

15:24.924 --> 15:27.343
- Bloodlust?
- Akane Tendo.

15:27.968 --> 15:29.053
You're dead meat!

15:31.847 --> 15:33.015
You again?

15:33.098 --> 15:35.726
Ambush first thing in the morning?
How brazen of you.

15:35.809 --> 15:37.311
Ambush?

15:37.394 --> 15:39.396
That's a baseless accusation.

15:39.480 --> 15:41.023
I just came to say hello.

15:41.523 --> 15:45.235
Also, I came to see my Ranma, not you.

15:45.319 --> 15:49.907
Then run over to Ranma already!

15:52.701 --> 15:54.954
My Ranma, wait for me!

15:55.871 --> 15:57.122
I'm not a fan.

15:59.208 --> 16:00.250
<i>Akane.</i>

16:01.293 --> 16:04.797
<i>I can already picture
your elegant rhythmic gymnastics.</i>

16:05.714 --> 16:08.258
<i>I'll gift this rose bouquet of passion
to show my support.</i>

16:09.259 --> 16:10.552
Akane, I love you!

16:12.179 --> 16:13.806
Hey! The hell is this for?

16:14.390 --> 16:15.766
Ranma Saotome.

16:15.849 --> 16:18.560
What grudge do you have against me?

16:18.644 --> 16:21.480
Hey, you're the one who started it--

16:23.440 --> 16:24.775
What's this?

16:25.359 --> 16:28.237
Ranma my darling.

16:31.198 --> 16:32.324
Very well.

16:32.408 --> 16:33.409
What?

16:34.451 --> 16:36.036
I approve, you may date her.

16:36.120 --> 16:37.621
I'm elated, my Ranma.

16:37.705 --> 16:41.166
Wait a hot minute,
I don't want to date you--

16:44.086 --> 16:46.714
Don't you like me?

16:46.797 --> 16:49.466
I was sayin', I'm...

16:49.550 --> 16:52.052
I'm engaged to her. She's my fiancée.

16:52.136 --> 16:53.595
So, you know, I...

16:53.679 --> 16:54.847
Hey.

16:54.930 --> 16:56.932
Does it look like I have a choice here?

16:57.016 --> 16:58.475
You're pathetic, you know.

16:58.559 --> 17:00.686
- Engaged?
- Look, a lover's quarrel.

17:00.769 --> 17:02.229
With her?

17:02.980 --> 17:04.857
- On paper, yes.
- A love triangle.

17:06.233 --> 17:07.359
I'm intrigued.

17:11.780 --> 17:13.032
How about this?

17:13.115 --> 17:16.285
What if the winner of our upcoming match
gets to claim my Ranma?

17:16.368 --> 17:18.287
- Huh?
- Say what?

17:18.871 --> 17:19.997
Give me a break--

17:20.581 --> 17:22.499
Why not go along with it, Akane--

17:23.292 --> 17:26.211
Losing is your ticket
to get out of the engagement.

17:26.295 --> 17:27.296
What?

17:28.422 --> 17:30.007
No need to lose on purpose.

17:30.090 --> 17:32.551
I'll beat you to a pulp regardless.

17:34.053 --> 17:35.054
My Ranma.

17:35.554 --> 17:39.058
Once this is over,
you will be mine to hold.

17:42.311 --> 17:43.562
Farewell.

17:44.438 --> 17:46.732
- Black roses?
- A storm of rose petals!

17:52.571 --> 17:55.157
Geez, she's a total freak.

17:55.699 --> 17:57.117
Anyhow, Ranma Saotome.

17:57.701 --> 17:59.328
My little sister is in your care.

18:02.873 --> 18:05.834
Hold on, say that again.

18:06.752 --> 18:09.713
I said take care of my little sister.

18:11.673 --> 18:13.467
I shouldn't say this as her brother,

18:14.301 --> 18:16.053
but she is gloomy, resentful,

18:16.136 --> 18:18.430
and bad-tempered,
but also rotten to the core.

18:19.598 --> 18:22.726
Akane, I pray for your safety
during the match.

18:24.353 --> 18:26.855
Kodachi is tenacious
when she's set on a man.

18:27.481 --> 18:29.566
She is bound to play dirty...

18:30.442 --> 18:33.612
Tatewaki's little sister.

18:34.321 --> 18:36.949
I see nothing but resemblances.

18:38.992 --> 18:40.869
THE NIGHT BEFORE THE MATCH

19:00.472 --> 19:02.099
Hold still!

19:05.144 --> 19:06.145
Hup.

19:06.728 --> 19:09.148
Give up and act as my target.

19:10.524 --> 19:13.318
It didn't take you long
to pick it up. Good work!

19:13.402 --> 19:14.903
Don't change the subject.

19:14.987 --> 19:16.363
Let me make this clear.

19:16.446 --> 19:18.991
I'm not trying to win for your sake.

19:19.575 --> 19:21.118
Oh, I know.

19:21.201 --> 19:25.038
Anyhow, this is
Martial Arts Rhythmic Gymnastics.

19:25.122 --> 19:27.499
I can't practice without a partner.

19:29.543 --> 19:32.171
And Ryoga hasn't been around
for the last few days.

19:32.671 --> 19:34.131
I thought I could rely on him.

19:36.550 --> 19:37.843
P-chan!

19:41.138 --> 19:43.432
Hey, I haven't seen you in a while either.

19:43.515 --> 19:44.933
Where were you?

19:45.434 --> 19:48.103
Maple leaf manju and unbaked yatsuhashi.

19:48.187 --> 19:49.855
Hiroshima and Kyoto, huh?

19:51.273 --> 19:54.318
Where were you really
trying to reach, P-chan?

19:54.902 --> 19:57.362
You are terrible with directions.

19:59.615 --> 20:00.908
Terrible with directions?

20:00.991 --> 20:02.701
Come on, it's not like he's Ryoga.

20:05.370 --> 20:06.580
Let's get into it.

20:06.663 --> 20:07.998
Time for practice.

20:08.081 --> 20:10.834
How many times
do I have to tell you? Be nice.

20:13.337 --> 20:14.338
Good to go.

20:18.884 --> 20:20.719
You finally decided to help.

20:21.261 --> 20:22.930
All right, I won't hold back.

20:42.115 --> 20:44.451
You're all set, Akane.

20:46.536 --> 20:50.165
You tripped and twisted your ankle?
You're one clumsy girl.

20:50.749 --> 20:53.877
You need to forfeit tomorrow's match.

20:53.961 --> 20:55.087
I'm competing!

20:55.170 --> 20:57.673
There's no way I'm losing to that woman.

20:57.756 --> 20:59.549
Careful, Akane.

21:00.300 --> 21:01.760
- Ouch!
- Are you okay?

21:01.843 --> 21:03.053
Ouch, ouch...

21:03.136 --> 21:05.806
You need to find yourself a replacement.

21:05.889 --> 21:07.474
That's easier said than done.

21:07.975 --> 21:11.228
Not many girls can move gracefully,
have a good physique,

21:11.311 --> 21:14.189
and have experience in fighting...

21:15.607 --> 21:16.608
What's that?

21:18.735 --> 21:22.072
Hey now, cut it out.

21:22.155 --> 21:24.283
There's no way I'll wear a leotard--

21:26.994 --> 21:28.620
Time to train all night.

21:29.871 --> 21:30.872
What?

22:56.958 --> 23:01.963
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
